@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
title Framed host reset/failure boundary (existing contract)

[*] --> Ready : new host instance\n(new runId)
Ready --> Ready : frame succeeds /\npublish last completed result
Ready --> Ready : pre-conditioning validation\nrejected (retry allowed)
Ready --> Faulted : conditioning or\nVM dispatch fails
Faulted : fault latched
Faulted : last committed result\nstays available
Faulted --> [*] : further steps need\na new host instance
@enduml
